Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-vrr
Version: 1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: xlibre
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Variable refresh rate for the modesetting and amdgpu drivers
 X11 OutputClass section that enables variable refresh rate in the
 modesetting driver of XLibre or the amdgpu DDX (default: off). VRR is
 only used by fullscreen applications that flip via the Present
 extension on a VRR-capable display. Not recommended for experiments
 that need a fixed refresh rate.
